@--[end]. This communication exists, but not one of the Heavens in themselves.

@396[3]. Communications of love and its delights between married partners are effected through the sense of touch; the reason communications of the mind are thereby effected is that the hands are man's ultimates...

@TCR 209[4]. Hence it was evident to me that there is no communication with Heaven through the Word with those who are in falsities of doctrine...

