@824. "Great signs" = confirmations from the Word in favour of faith separated from good works.

@1109. When in thought he confirms evils, they become destructive...

@DWis 12. 2. (Second series). They who are in the love of truth are actually in the light of Heaven... All others are only in the confirmation of their own principles, without knowing whether they are true or false. When those who are in the love of truth read the Word, and think from it, they keep the sight of their understanding constantly in the principle itself, and thus inquire whether it is true, before it is confirmed; all others assume a principle from the knowledge of the memory... and then confirm it by the Word and by reason... Everything can be thus confirmed...

