@3982[end]. Hence is the consociation of man with the Angels (through the Word).

@4121. In the other life, all are consociated according to affections, and they who are consociated constitute a brotherhood.

@5764. The Societies in Hell are so instituted, that they act all together as one against good, thus are they kept consociated... But in the world, the good are consociated with the evil...

@5807[2]. The Natural of love is the delight of consociation and conjunction.

@7085. Hence it follows, that in the other life all are consociated according to loves... They who are in love towards the neighbour and in love to God are consociated in Heaven, and they who are in the love of self and the love of the world are consociated in Hell.

