@10130[3]. (In the Spiritual World) all are consociated according to loves; they who are in love to the Lord from the Lord, are consociated in the inmost Heaven; they who are in love towards the neighbour from the Lord, are consociated in the middle Heaven; they who are in the obedience of faith, that is, who do truth for the sake of truth, are consociated in the ultimate Heaven; but they who are in the love of self and of the world... are consociated in Hell. @HH 479. @TCR 569.

@10215[2]. Such is the consociation of the Angels with man.

@10312. Spirits are consociated and dissociated according to affections and thence thoughts.

