@2468[2]. Such a religiosity falls into those who are in natural good, but who despise others in comparison with themselves.

@2910[2]. Under these loves, hatred against the neighbour hides itself, which is such that... when their loves are attacked, they store up in their disposition contempt against that neighbour...

@3318[3]. Temptations take away those things which are... of contempt for others in comparison with ourselves...

