@1953. They who labour much in controversies...

@1955. In proportion as the mind is intent upon controversies, the truth perishes...

@4391. Heresies and controversies. Signified.

@AE 365[4]. This is the origin of all dissensions controversies, and heresies in the Church.

Contumacious. See <Stubborn>.

