@9741[3]. The external of each Heaven is what is called the ultimate or first Heaven, and was represented by "the court": hence the court was twofold about the temple, exterior, and interior: the exterior court = those who are in the externals of the Spiritual Kingdom, and the interior court, those who are in the externals of the Celestial Kingdom. See 1 Kings 6:3, 36. 2 Kings 21:4. Ezekiel 40:17, 31, 34, 42, and also Ezekiel 40:23, 28, 32, 44; 42:3; 43:5.

@9742[end]. Hence the court was on the south of the habitation.

